sys.no_model_guide:
⚠️ No local model is available right now, so inference is unavailable (file parsing, settings and the model market still work).

Three ways to fix it:
1. Open Settings → Model → Model market, then search for and download a model (ones marked "(Recommended)" are picked for your hardware);
2. Copy a .gguf file into the models folder manually, then click "Rescan models folder";
3. If you already have a model, click "Load" in the local model library.

Models folder: {dir}

